  "motion": {
    "easeOut": "cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)",
    "easeInOut": "cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)",
    "micro": 80,
    "flow": 160,
    "reveal": 240,
    "cinematic": 400
  },
  "spacing": {
    "xs": "0.5rem",
    "sm": "0.75rem",
    "md": "1rem",
    "lg": "1.5rem",
    "xl": "2rem",
    "2xl": "3rem"
  },
  "extensions": {
    "sourceUrl": "https://linear.app",
    "notes": [
      "Surfaces and ink measured on linear.app 2026-09-27 (computed styles, area-weighted) — see DESIGN.md.",
      "VI decided for the site 2026-09-27 (owner picked candidate B): the blue→cyan gradient is a signature only — the brand mark and one keyword per screen, via --brand-decorative-signature. The ring is VI blue lifted for the void (#6B93F5, the House dark ring). Chrome stays Linear grayscale.",
      "Action is monochrome (Ink 1 fill, Void ink), as Linear's own primary button.",
      "Typography is the House decision of 2026-09-25 (DM Sans 500 headings, Geist body, MiSans CJK); this package does not change type.",
      "Scoped to the Nebutra site's own shell (html[data-brand]). The template carries it in the catalog, but nothing there applies it; never applied to product apps.",
      "No `brand` role: the emit pipeline maps roles.brand to shadcn `accent` (the hover/selected surface), which painted SidebarNav's current page and FilterPills' active pill in #0033FE. The mark carries its own colour (Logomark), so the role is not needed here.",
      "Light mode 2026-09-29: Linear's measured light surfaces, House ink primary and House blue ring; dark stays the measured void. The site defaults to dark."
    ],
    "decorative": {
      "signature": "linear-gradient(120deg, hsl(223 87.3% 69%) 0%, hsl(168 91.3% 49.4%) 100%)"
    }
  },
